{"title":"Lighting the Corners Of Our Minds","link":"http://bestof.metafilter.com/2025/01/Lighting-the-corners-of-our-minds","date":1738053660000,"content":"<p><img src=\"//mefi.us/images/bestof/548C56C8AF3D6100CF6B63A9058BC475.jpg\" width=\"500\" height=\"334\" alt=\"A row of four Bell-branded phone booths mounted on a concrete wall, each containing a payphone with black handsets and coin slots. The two booths on the left have black metal cases hanging below them. The image features a slightly worn, urban aesthetic with visible scratches and marks on the booths and wall, emphasizing a sense of decay or obsolescence.\" /><br /><span>They are called P A Y P H O N E S</span></p><p>Are you ... how shall we say? Of a certain age? <a href=\"https://ask.metafilter.com/384173/For-the-over-50s-What-used-to-be-but-is-no-more\">For the over 50s, what used to be but is no more?</a> People are sharing all the things in Ask Metafilter!</p>","author":"taz","siteTitle":"Best of MetaFilter","siteHash":"da9b129197e360b054d48df4b2b523c9cf9eb040c0f8107f5b90f9a1588086c5","entryHash":"d3c777e9125f35b1ba63d94ec5d567a31ce44ace259765c71f2c9050070d621d","category":"Sites"}